{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Therapeutic sessions, short intensive series and group events to help you reflect and move forward with care and clarity.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="about.html">Who I Am</a></li>
          <li><a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">How I Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Investment</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html">Events & Courses</a></li>
          <li><a href="faq.html">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class="header-cta">
        <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
      <button class="menu-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="nav">Menu</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal" id="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Time to notice where you are and choose your next careful move.</h1>
          <p class="lede">Short series, focused sessions, and small workshops to help you sort what matters and act with intention.</p>
          <p class="meta">Virtual and in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Sessions held with attention to privacy and clinical boundaries.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <button class="btn ghost" id="tryExercise">Try an exercise now</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
            <defs>
              <pattern id="p" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
                <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#f7fbfc"></rect>
                <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="3" fill="#e6f0f2"></circle>
                <path d="M0 40 L40 0" stroke="#d7eef2" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.8"></path>
              </pattern>
            </defs>
            <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)"></rect>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="framework reveal" id="framework">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Simple structure to help you notice, name, and act</h2>
        <p class="sub">Each offering follows a clear rhythm so you always know what to expect.</p>
        <div class="cards">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Meet & Map</h3>
            <p>We clarify values, pressures, and the decision points that matter to you right now.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Targeted Work</h3>
            <p>Short course or focused sessions addressing the thing at hand — transitions, overwhelm, relationship shifts.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Next Steps</h3>
            <p>Practical strategies and an agreed plan for when and how you want to follow up.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="offers reveal" id="offers">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ways to work together</h2>
        <p class="sub">Flexible formats so support fits your current rhythm.</p>
        <ul class="offer-list">
          <li>
            <h3>Short Focus Series</h3>
            <p>Three sessions over six weeks to surface patterns and try new moves.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Intensive Deep Session</h3>
            <p>A longer single meeting to get clear on a pressing decision or plan a transition.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Small Workshop Series</h3>
            <p>Practical group learning with time for personal reflection and gentle peer feedback.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="offers-cta">
          <a class="btn primary" href="book.html">See upcoming dates</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="story reveal" id="story">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>A clinical approach grounded in curiosity</h2>
        <p>I work collaboratively and directly: noticing what gets in the way, naming patterns, and helping you try modest, sensible steps that fit your life. Sessions are confidential and within clear clinical scope.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing reveal" id="pricing">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Investment & options</h2>
        <p class="sub">Transparent options so you can choose what fits right now.</p>
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <div class="price">
            <h3>Pay-per-session</h3>
            <p class="amount">Starting at $145</p>
            <p>Single sessions for when you need a standalone touchpoint.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price">
            <h3>Three-Session Series</h3>
            <p class="amount">Packaged rate available</p>
            <p>Discounted block to cover a short, focused course of work.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="price">
            <h3>Workshop rates</h3>
            <p class="amount">Varies by format</p>
            <p>Group offerings priced per event. Sliding scale available for limited spots.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Insurance reimbursement may be possible—I can provide a receipt you can submit. No guarantees made here; coverage varies by plan.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="testimonials reveal" id="testimonials">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Client reflections</h2>
        <blockquote>
          "Clear-headed sessions that helped me see options and try one step at a time. I appreciated the directness and practical planning."
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote>
          "The workshop gave me language for feelings I kept ignoring. Small practices I could actually do afterward."
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta reveal" id="final-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
        <p>Schedule a conversation to find the right first step.</p>
        <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        <button class="btn ghost" id="tryExercise2">Try an exercise now</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="contact">
        <p>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        <p class="address">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and remote clients.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal">
        <p>Confidentiality: Sessions are kept private within clinical and legal limits. Scope: My work is therapeutic, not a substitute for emergency care. If you are in crisis or having thoughts of harming yourself or others, please call your local emergency number or a crisis line immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div id="exerciseModal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-inner">
      <button class="modal-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <h3 id="exerciseTitle">Guided practice</h3>
      <div id="exerciseContent">
        <p>Select a short practice:</p>
        <div class="exercise-controls">
          <button class="btn" data-ex="breathing">Breathing</button>
          <button class="btn" data-ex="journaling">Journaling</button>
          <button class="btn" data-ex="intention">Set an intention</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="modalOverlay" class="overlay" hidden></div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
